comments.body:
While I agree that XSS is incorrect, it has the the benefit of being well known term which is widely understood and easily searchable through a document. If we are to change the terminology and phase XSS out of the document, it might be useful to make it easy for people to:

1. understand we are talking about this;
2. find the correct requirements when they are searching for XSS.

Should we come up with a term which would be used throughout the document and update the appendix in order to:

1. have an entry for this term;
2. have an entry for XSS;
3. cross-references between these two.
